---
interface Props {
  heading?: string | null;
}
const { heading = 'Where is the moisture? The depth tells you.' } = Astro.props;
---
<figure class="glass-diagram">
  {heading && <figcaption class="diagram-heading">{heading}</figcaption>}
  <p class="diagram-intro">Stop looking at the fog as a spot on the glass. Look at the <strong>depth</strong>: between the panes, or on the room-facing surface.</p>

  <div class="glass-cases">
    <article class="glass-case glass-failed">
      <div class="case-head">
        <div class="case-index">A</div>
        <div>
          <p class="case-kicker">Seal failure</p>
          <h3>Fog is trapped inside the insulated glass unit</h3>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-drawing" role="img" aria-label="Side section of an insulated glass unit. Two glass panes are separated by a sealed cavity. Fog and moisture droplets are inside that cavity, between the panes. The room is shown on the right.">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 860 390" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="failed-cavity" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="currentColor" stop-opacity=".02" />
              <stop offset=".5" stop-color="currentColor" stop-opacity=".10" />
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="currentColor" stop-opacity=".02" />
            </linearGradient>
            <marker id="failed-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
              <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z" class="marker-danger" />
            </marker>
          </defs>
          <rect x="24" y="32" width="812" height="326" rx="18" class="drawing-field" />
          <text x="65" y="62" class="zone-label">EXTERIOR</text>
          <text x="720" y="62" class="zone-label room-zone">ROOM</text>

          <rect x="220" y="98" width="22" height="205" class="glass-pane pane-out" />
          <rect x="550" y="98" width="22" height="205" class="glass-pane pane-in" />
          <rect x="242" y="116" width="308" height="169" rx="4" class="sealed-cavity" />
          <rect x="242" y="98" width="308" height="18" rx="4" class="spacer-failed" />
          <rect x="242" y="285" width="308" height="18" rx="4" class="spacer-failed" />
          <path d="M242 102 H550" class="failed-seal" />

          <g class="fog-group">
            <circle cx="300" cy="160" r="12" />
            <circle cx="355" cy="220" r="18" />
            <circle cx="415" cy="148" r="10" />
            <circle cx="470" cy="205" r="20" />
            <circle cx="435" cy="250" r="11" />
            <circle cx="325" cy="265" r="8" />
          </g>

          <line x1="230" y1="318" x2="230" y2="340" class="dim-line" />
          <line x1="550" y1="318" x2="550" y2="340" class="dim-line" />
          <line x1="230" y1="331" x2="550" y2="331" class="dim-line" />
          <text x="390" y="354" class="dimension-label">INSULATED CAVITY</text>

          <line x1="390" y1="142" x2="390" y2="84" class="leader danger" marker-end="url(#failed-arrow)" />
          <text x="390" y="70" class="callout danger-text">1 · MOISTURE IS HERE</text>
          <text x="390" y="86" class="supporting danger-text">between the panes</text>

          <line x1="242" y1="102" x2="150" y2="80" class="leader danger" />
          <text x="50" y="105" class="callout">2 · FAILED SEAL</text>
          <text x="50" y="123" class="supporting">cavity is no longer protected</text>

          <line x1="572" y1="200" x2="650" y2="200" class="leader" />
          <text x="660" y="195" class="callout">3 · ROOM-SIDE PANE</text>
          <text x="660" y="213" class="supporting">cloth cannot reach the fog</text>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="case-answer"><strong>What you are seeing:</strong> permanent haze or droplets that remain after wiping the room-side surface.</div>
    </article>

    <article class="glass-case glass-condensation">
      <div class="case-head">
        <div class="case-index">B</div>
        <div>
          <p class="case-kicker">Surface condensation</p>
          <h3>Water is on the room-facing surface of the glass</h3>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-drawing" role="img" aria-label="Side section of a sound insulated glass unit. Two glass panes are separated by an intact sealed cavity. Water droplets form on the room-facing surface of the inner pane, outside the sealed unit.">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 860 390" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs>
            <marker id="condense-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
              <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z" class="marker-accent" />
            </marker>
          </defs>
          <rect x="24" y="32" width="812" height="326" rx="18" class="drawing-field" />
          <text x="65" y="62" class="zone-label">EXTERIOR</text>
          <text x="720" y="62" class="zone-label room-zone">ROOM</text>

          <rect x="220" y="98" width="22" height="205" class="glass-pane pane-out" />
          <rect x="550" y="98" width="22" height="205" class="glass-pane pane-in" />
          <rect x="242" y="116" width="308" height="169" rx="4" class="sealed-cavity" />
          <rect x="242" y="98" width="308" height="18" rx="4" class="spacer-good" />
          <rect x="242" y="285" width="308" height="18" rx="4" class="spacer-good" />

          <text x="396" y="195" class="gas-title">SEALED CAVITY</text>
          <text x="396" y="216" class="gas-sub">insulating gas stays between panes</text>

          <g class="drops">
            <circle cx="600" cy="142" r="8" />
            <circle cx="625" cy="175" r="11" />
            <circle cx="594" cy="210" r="6" />
            <circle cx="635" cy="238" r="9" />
            <circle cx="600" cy="270" r="7" />
          </g>
          <path d="M575 100 V302" class="room-surface" />

          <line x1="610" y1="176" x2="610" y2="83" class="leader accent" marker-end="url(#condense-arrow)" />
          <text x="610" y="70" class="callout accent-text">1 · WATER IS HERE</text>
          <text x="610" y="88" class="supporting accent-text">on the room-side face</text>

          <line x1="550" y1="118" x2="650" y2="105" class="leader" />
          <text x="660" y="105" class="callout">2 · INNER PANE</text>
          <text x="660" y="123" class="supporting">the sealed unit can still be intact</text>

          <line x1="396" y1="255" x2="396" y2="318" class="leader" />
          <text x="396" y="340" class="callout centered">3 · SEALED CAVITY STAYS CLEAR</text>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="case-answer"><strong>What you are seeing:</strong> water that can be wiped from the room-side surface. Humidity and the glass temperature affect how much forms.</div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="field-test">
    <div class="test-index">TEST</div>
    <div><strong>Wipe the room side first.</strong> Clear after wiping = surface condensation. Still hazy between the panes = failed insulated glass.</div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .glass-diagram{margin:0}
  .diagram-heading{display:block;margin:0 0 var(--space-2xs);font-size:var(--step-2);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-display);line-height:var(--leading-display)}
  .diagram-intro{margin:0 0 var(--space-l);max-width:68ch;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:var(--step--1)}
  .diagram-intro strong{color:var(--ink)}
  .glass-cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:var(--space-l)}
  .glass-case{padding:var(--space-m);border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:3px solid var(--ink);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:var(--paper-raised)}
  .glass-failed{border-top-color:var(--danger)}.glass-condensation{border-top-color:var(--accent)}
  .case-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.8rem 1fr;gap:var(--space-s);align-items:start;margin-bottom:var(--space-s)}
  .case-index{display:grid;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-size:var(--step-0);font-weight:750}
  .glass-failed .case-index{background:var(--danger)}.glass-condensation .case-index{background:var(--accent)}
  .case-kicker{margin:0 0 .15rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label);font-size:var(--step--2);font-weight:650;color:var(--ink-faint)}
  .case-head h3{margin:0;font-size:var(--step-1);line-height:1.15}
  .section-drawing{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--paper-sunk)}
  .section-drawing svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
  .drawing-field{fill:var(--paper-sunk);stroke:var(--line);stroke-width:1.5}
  .zone-label{fill:var(--ink-faint);font:700 12px Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em}
  .room-zone{text-anchor:end}
  .glass-pane{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 18%,transparent);stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:2.5}
  .pane-out{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent-2) 22%,transparent)}
  .pane-in{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 24%,transparent)}
  .sealed-cavity{fill:url(#failed-cavity);stroke:var(--line);stroke-width:1.5}
  .spacer-failed{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--danger) 15%,transparent);stroke:var(--danger);stroke-width:2}
  .spacer-good{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 14%,transparent);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2}
  .failed-seal{stroke:var(--danger);stroke-width:4;stroke-dasharray:8 6}
  .fog-group circle{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--danger) 34%,transparent)}
  .drops circle{fill:var(--accent-ink)}
  .room-surface{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:5;stroke-dasharray:4 6}
  .gas-title{fill:var(--ink);font:750 15px Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;text-anchor:middle}.gas-sub{fill:var(--ink-faint);font:11px Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}
  .leader{fill:none;stroke:var(--ink-soft);stroke-width:2}.danger{stroke:var(--danger)}.accent{stroke:var(--accent)}
  .marker-danger{fill:var(--danger)}.marker-accent{fill:var(--accent)}
  .callout{fill:var(--ink);font:750 12px Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em}.danger-text{fill:var(--danger)}.accent-text{fill:var(--accent-ink)}
  .supporting{fill:var(--ink-soft);font:550 11px Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif}.centered{text-anchor:middle}
  .dim-line{stroke:var(--ink-faint);stroke-width:1.5}.dimension-label{fill:var(--ink-faint);font:700 11px Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-anchor:middle}
  .case-answer{margin-top:var(--space-s);padding:.8rem .9rem;border-left:3px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper-sunk);color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:var(--step--1)}
  .glass-failed .case-answer{border-left-color:var(--danger)}.glass-condensation .case-answer{border-left-color:var(--accent)}.case-answer strong{color:var(--ink)}
  .field-test{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:var(--space-s);align-items:center;margin-top:var(--space-l);padding:var(--space-s) var(--space-m);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper-raised);font-size:var(--step--1);color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .test-index{font-size:var(--step--2);font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink)}
  @media(max-width:900px){.glass-cases{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
